{
  "_readme": [
    "Editable roster used by the headline parser. Nothing here affects a rumour's",
    "probability — it only helps decide whether a name is an arrival or a",
    "departure, and stops staff/pundits being treated as transfer targets.",
    "",
    "`squad`        players currently on the books (drives incoming vs outgoing)",
    "`knownTargets` names to always accept as players even in messy headlines",
    "`mononyms`     players commonly written as a single name",
    "`staff`        managers/coaches — never treated as transfer subjects here",
    "`ignorePeople` pundits, journalists, executives, other clubs' managers",
    "",
    "This list is a best-effort snapshot and will drift. The build also infers",
    "squad membership at runtime from phrases like \"Tottenham's <name>\" and",
    "\"Spurs star <name>\", so a stale entry degrades gracefully rather than",
    "breaking the board. Keeping it current just makes direction calls sharper."
  ],
